# The prospectus-extractor delivery gate compares a rendered in-memory string
# (always LF) against the file on disk byte-for-byte -- see build_manifest.py's
# content_match. The renderers use write_bytes() to keep output pure LF, so git
# must not rewrite line endings on checkout, whatever core.autocrlf is set to.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary deliverables and fixtures: never touch.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary
